{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:12.70.020","page_type":"section"},"citation":"12.70.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.020","content_hash":"12c5ad3b4c2a947458a4767e1a1188083f50226f8d17578ccd0225b77db66983","heading":"Permit required – Exceptions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.020:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.020","text":"(a) Permit Required. It shall be unlawful for any person to conduct a special event without a special event permit issued by the City Manager or designee.\n(b) Exceptions. A special event permit is not required for the following activities:\n(1) Special events conducted by the City;\n(2) Funeral processions;\n(3) Processions or marches conducted entirely on sidewalks where the participants comply with traffic regulations and traffic control devices. (Ord. 20038 § 16, 12-6-16.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"87d37b52-b8c4-5777-a080-4d1f86987e2c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.70.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.020","content_hash":"a8f00c9c2f7017ea8ff6992a0f673ec95fbfaa35f85eb6fefc095f296a900c91","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.70.020:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.70.020","text":"(a) Permit Required. It shall be unlawful for any person to conduct a special event without a special event permit issued by the City Manager or designee.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1b0a48fc-9271-514e-9347-1d4de4d34741"},{"attributes":{"block_kind"